# Fillet edges where a flat face meets a cone (an extension): the
# frustum of testdata/topo/frustum.tlspr (frustum.go), turned by a lathe;
# the circle its top's rim traces, picked on the turned view, is
# rounded all round by New Group > Fillet Edges with a torus between the
# top and the cone. Check Solid finds it sound, and again at a new
# radius.
file $testdata/topo/frustum.tlspr
menu File|Open...
view rotated
menu View|Zoom To Fit
move 370 295
down L 370 295
up L 370 295
menu Features|Fillet Edges
dump
tw
answer ok
menu Analyze|Check Solid
twmove 150 125
twdown L 150 125
twup L 150 125
edit 2
tw
answer ok
menu Analyze|Check Solid
